url='https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=122149671651172155&set=a.122101120425172155';sid='122149671747172155';slug='australia-graduate-employment-who-when-denominator-location';p=photos['peter']
title=t('澳洲就業率，先看誰：留學家庭別被一個百分比說服','Australian graduate employment: ask who the percentage describes')
desc=t('Peter提醒先問對象、時間、分母與地點；QILT本地生三年追蹤與國際生短期調查不能混成個人留澳成功率。','Peter asks readers to check population, timing, denominator and location. QILT’s domestic longitudinal and international short-term measures are not a personal chance of staying employed in Australia.')
pairs=[('Peter於11月8日09:56發布的新文提醒，真實的就業率也可能被套用到不適合的對象。本文保留原文的四個問題：對象、時間、分母、地點，並核對原始調查；沒有新增學生訪談，也沒有將原文示意算式當成官方樣本。','Peter’s November 8 post, published at 09:56 Taipei time, warns that an accurate employment rate can still be applied to the wrong population. This verified adaptation retains four questions—who, when, denominator and location—and checks the underlying surveys. It adds no student interviews and does not treat an illustrative calculation as survey data.'),('2026年QILT長期調查列本地大學部畢業生約三年後全職就業率91.8%；2025年短期調查則列畢業四至六個月後國際大學部50.8%、本地75.4%。91.8%和50.8%不是同一群人的前後變化，不能拿來估算台灣學生的個人工作機率。長期報告曾於10月22日修正，須使用現行版本。','The 2026 QILT longitudinal survey reports 91.8% full-time employment among domestic undergraduates around three years after completion. The 2025 short-term survey reports 50.8% for international and 75.4% for domestic undergraduates four to six months after completion. The 91.8% and 50.8% figures are not a before-and-after comparison of one cohort or a Taiwanese student’s probability of employment. The longitudinal report was corrected on October 22; use the current version.'),('全職就業率的分母是符合可投入全職就業定義的人，並非所有畢業生；全職指每週至少35小時。國際生調查的工作所在地也不只澳洲，因此50.8%不能改稱留澳就業成功率。2025年計算勞動力的方式有調整，跨年差異可能部分來自方法，不能全部歸因景氣或學生能力。','The denominator is graduates available for full-time employment, not all graduates, and full-time means at least 35 hours weekly. International respondents are not restricted to those working in Australia, so 50.8% is not a stay-in-Australia success rate. A change to the labour-force definition in 2025 affects comparisons with earlier years; differences cannot all be attributed to the economy or individual ability.'),('Study Melbourne的就業倡議指出招聘慣例與雇主認知障礙可能限制國際學生的機會，並鼓勵增加工作經驗與聘用。Peter因此主張同時檢查個人準備及學校支持：學生可累積作品與溝通能力，學校應說明職涯服務如何連接雇主。這是有來源支持的觀點，統計差距本身並沒有證明單一原因。','Study Melbourne identifies recruitment practices and perceived employer barriers as possible limits on international opportunities and encourages work experience and hiring. Peter argues for examining both preparation and institutional support: students can develop work samples and communication, while universities explain employer connections. This is an evidence-informed perspective, not proof of a single cause from a statistical gap.'),('學生可向科系詢問同學位、同領域國際生資料，並核對樣本數、職務內容與所在地；家長則把求職等待期放進預算，討論回台與其他市場的可能路線。原生粉專查閱至11月4日，11月7日實習、11月6日善意及11月5日UCAS等文章已收錄，今天僅匯入這一篇真正新文，不重複計數。','Students can request international-graduate data for the same degree and field, checking sample size, job content and location. Families can budget for a job-search period and discuss Taiwan and other markets. The native feed was checked back to November 4; the November 7 placement, November 6 kindness and November 5 UCAS articles were already imported. Only this genuinely new post is added today.')]
a=dict(slug=slug,title=title,date=D,category=t('留學準備','Study abroad preparation'),country=t('澳洲','Australia'),excerpt=desc,description=desc,sourceId=sid,sourceUrl=url,image='/'+p['file'].removeprefix('public/'),imageAlt=t('墨爾本大學Parkville校區門房資料照','Archive photograph of the gatekeeper’s cottage at Melbourne’s Parkville campus'),imageCredit=p['author']+' / '+p['license'],imageSource=p['source'],imageLicense=p['license'],imageRights=p['license'],imageCaption=t('校園授權資料照，並非受訪畢業生或就業現場。','Licensed campus archive photograph, not surveyed graduates or their workplaces.'),body=[t(z,e) for z,e in pairs],sources=[['Peter — original native post',url],['QILT — current longitudinal summary',long],['QILT — international report and methodology',gos],['Study Melbourne — employer barriers',vic]],topic=t('畢業生就業數據','Graduate employment data'),author='Peter',importedAt=D,originalDate='2026-11-08T09:56:00+08:00',originalDateLabel=t('2026年11月8日上午9:56','November 8, 2026 at 9:56 a.m. Taipei'),originalDatePrecision='minute',dateObservedAt=NOW,edition='verified-edit',note=t('原生全文、時間及官方統計核對完成。','Native full text, timestamp and official statistics checked.'))
