degree='https://www.swinburne.edu.au/course/undergraduate/bachelor-of-computer-science-professional/'
faq='https://swinburne.custhelp.com/app/answers/detail/a_id/1507/~/what-is-a-professional-degree'
nofix='https://swinburne.custhelp.com/app/answers/detail/a_id/1527/related/1'
r['studyAbroadPrepared']=write('diy','swinburne-computer-science-wil-placement-choice','想用作品累積澳洲職場經驗？讀懂Swinburne的專案與實習差別','Building practical experience in Australia: Swinburne projects versus placements','電腦科學Professional課程列產業專案及12個月實習機會；工作整合學習的安排，不能直接等同保證有薪職位。','The professional computer science course combines industry projects with a twelve-month placement opportunity. Work-integrated learning does not itself guarantee a paid job.',[
('從科技校園看學習方式','From a technology campus to learning design','Swinburne在墨爾本的Hawthorn校園是今天的選校起點。其電腦科學Professional課程頁列六個產業連結專案與12個月有薪實習機會，將作品、課程學分和工作接觸放在一起。對台灣學生，重點是自己會做哪些專案與如何獲得回饋，而不只是看到Professional字樣就假定畢業前已有工作。','Today’s selection exercise begins at Swinburne’s Hawthorn campus in Melbourne. Its professional computer science page lists six industry-linked projects and a twelve-month paid placement opportunity, connecting work samples, academic credit and industry exposure. Taiwanese applicants should ask what projects they will complete and how feedback works, rather than assume the word Professional promises a job.'),
('保證學習機會的範圍','The scope of the learning commitment','校方把工作整合學習機會納入學士課程，但2026年9月更新的FAQ明說Professional Placement職位具有競爭性，學生須申請，並不保證所有合資格者都取得。專案、實習與雇主聘用是不同安排；選課時應請校方說明自己入學年度適用的路徑，以及未取得職位時的課程選擇。','The university includes work-integrated learning in bachelor’s degrees, but its FAQ updated in September 2026 says professional placements are competitive, require applications and are not guaranteed to every eligible student. Projects, placements and employer recruitment are different arrangements. Ask which pathway applies to the intended intake and what course options exist if no position is secured.'),
('把雇主門檻納入準備','Prepare for employer selection','維州政府Study Melbourne另指出，國際學生可能遇到招聘慣例及雇主認知障礙。這個校外政策來源提醒，校方提供學習機會與個人取得工作之間仍有距離；它不是對Swinburne學生結果的專項調查。學生可以先整理作品、練習描述專案貢獻，並向校方確認履歷、面試與雇主接觸支持，避免只看實習長度。','Study Melbourne, a source outside the university, identifies recruitment practices and employer perceptions as barriers for international students. This contextual evidence does not measure Swinburne-specific outcomes, but explains why educational opportunities and individual employment differ. Applicants can prepare work samples and descriptions of their contribution, then ask about CV, interview and employer-contact support.'),
('用導航比較，再讀正式課程','Compare through the guide, then verify the course','留學DIY導航已收錄Swinburne，可用國家、科系與學習目標比較學校。本文不沿用舊版宣傳中的保證實習字句，也不虛構學生成功故事。請回到當年度官方課程與FAQ確認國際生條件、學制和費用，預算不先計入尚未取得的薪資；把學習內容和職場甄選分開，才能比較真正適合自己的選擇。','The DIY guide includes Swinburne and supports comparison by country, subject and learning goals. This article does not reuse older guaranteed-placement claims or invent student success stories. Check current course and FAQ pages for international eligibility, duration and fees, and do not budget from an unconfirmed salary. Separating learning design from recruitment makes comparisons more useful.')],[('Swinburne — current computer science degree',degree),('Study Melbourne — independent policy context',vic),('Swinburne — professional degree FAQ updated September2026',faq),('Swinburne — placements are not guaranteed',nofix)],'study-abroad',dict(category=t('留學DIY導航','Study abroad DIY'),country=t('澳洲','Australia'),topic='australia'))
